   "road": "{\"name\":\"Suiattle River Road (Forest Road 26)\",\"status\":\"Closed to vehicles at approximately milepost 4-4.5 due to a December 2025 flood washout; closed under USFS order #06-05-26-03, in effect April 2, 2026 through January 1, 2028 unless rescinded sooner. Foot and bike access continues beyond the closure toward the trailhead.\",\"walkMi\":16,\"driveNote\":\"From Darrington, drive Hwy 530 then Suiattle River Road (FR 26); verify current closure status with the Mt. Baker-Snoqualmie NF before driving.\",\"seasonalGate\":null}",
